# steps taken for completion
Opened the Attack Machine and launchd the Lab Machine.
AFter the Attack machine opened i checked the website and entered a chess game where its mate in One
Its Rook A1 to A8 but the issue is if that move is played we get a warning stating that says that it'll shutdown the computer if i do that.
Since this happened with no delay i thought it might be a rule in the server and tried inspecting the code and found the code making the rule popup but
i couldn't manage to remove the rule completely... Its still a black screen preventing me from playing the move so i checked BurpSuite 
The main problem with it was when i enter the IP of the Lab Machine i get blocked and the IP keeps getting requested but the SYN-ACK doesnt come through 
I noticed this only happens when i turn the intercept on and type the IP so, i turned off the interception and then opened the website... it loaded and then i turned the intercept mode
Then when i move the rook it still shows the alert message so i made a randm move and Burp captured the move...
I sent it to the repeater and then noticed that i had to change the values from and to in the code
For example if i did from f3 to f4 i had a piece move from f3 to f4 so i thought it may work with the rook too so i did it 
After scrolling down in the response tab i found the flag for the room




